/* ==========================================================================
   6. PRIORITY 1 + ANDROID PWA OVERRIDE: `useFloatingTimerPiP`
      Dual-Fallback Architecture:
      - Mode A (Android PWA Primary & Universal): 480x270 16:9 Canvas +
